codex
The fresh non-vacuity mutation built successfully and failed for the right reason: the residual requires the actual list to equal itself with an extra `"X"` prepended. With an empty-string witness, that is `[] = ["X"]`. I’m consolidating the seven stages now; the likely classification is a legitimate supplied-semantics proof with documented provenance and Python-model bridge concerns.
