+### Intent/model boundary witness
+
+The same evidence exposes a real but non-fatal bridge limitation:
+
+```text
+input "\fa":
+formal claim result = ["\fa"]
+canonical result    = ["a"]
+candidate result    = ["a"]
+
+input "a\u2003b":
+formal claim result = ["a\u2003b"]
